<section id="ontological-operators" class="level1" data-number="8">
<h1 data-number="8"><span class="header-section-number">8</span> Ontological Operators</h1>
<p>RTC proposes four ontological operators</p>
<p><img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?M_%7Bexp%7D%0A=%0A%5Calpha%20I%0A+%0A%5Cbeta%20C%0A+%0A%5Cgamma%20R%0A+%0A%5Cdelta%20V"></p>
<p>where</p>
<ul>
<li><p><strong>I</strong> = Inertia</p></li>
<li><p><strong>C</strong> = Cohesion</p></li>
<li><p><strong>R</strong> = Radiation</p></li>
<li><p><strong>V</strong> = Vibration</p></li>
</ul>
<p>These operators continuously generate Prima Experientia.</p>
</section>
